Diagrama de pacotes —
 assuntos
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "sec:diag_pacotes"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
O diagrama de pacotes apresentado na Figura 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:pacotes"
plural "false"
